.PP
Specifies the levels where aggressive or cluster coarsening is to be used\&. On the remaining levels, standard coarsening will be applied\&. Only relevant if nred>0\&. Standard choice: nredlev=0\&.

.PP
[3:3], nredlev 0-8 From level 1 up to level nredlev+1\&. 9 On all levels (not recommended)\&. 
